@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>This Inventory Management System (“the System”) is a capstone project developed by <strong>Arunava Saha</strong> for Wipro as part of the .NET training program.</p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">1. Data Collection</h4>
    <p>
        The System collects and stores data related to inventory items only, such as:
        <ul>
            <li>Item Name</li>
            <li>Quantity</li>
            <li>Price</li>
            <li>Category</li>
            <li>Supplier Information</li>
        </ul>
        No personal or sensitive user information is collected.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">2. Use of Data</h4>
    <p>
        The data collected through this application is solely used for inventory management and demonstration purposes. It is not shared, sold, or used for any marketing or third-party integrations.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">3. Data Security</h4>
    <p>
        Reasonable efforts have been made to ensure data security through standard practices in ASP.NET Core and Entity Framework. However, since this is a learning project, it is not intended for deployment in a production-critical environment without further security enhancements.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">4. Azure Hosting</h4>
    <p>
        The application may be hosted on Microsoft Azure for demonstration. Azure ensures compliance with modern cloud security standards. However, data availability and integrity are not guaranteed as this is a temporary academic deployment.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">5. Disclaimer</h4>
    <p>
        This system is created for educational and training purposes only. The developer does not take responsibility for any misuse, data loss, or security breaches that may arise from its use in unintended scenarios.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">For more information, please contact: <em>arunava.saha@example.com</em></p>
</div>
